WEBVTT

00:03:59.568 --> 00:04:02.238
that mystery is a father's child.

00:04:03.698 --> 00:04:09.370
The warm embrace with your child
on the other side of the mystery,

00:04:09.412 --> 00:04:10.746
that is beauty.

00:04:13.207 --> 00:04:16.794
Ben spent four years
separated from his child

00:04:16.794 --> 00:04:20.423
due to co-parenting issues.

00:04:20.464 --> 00:04:22.717
restraining orders

00:04:22.758 --> 00:04:25.219
and challenges navigating
the family court.

00:04:26.429 --> 00:04:28.973
But he also experienced shame

00:04:29.015 --> 00:04:32.351
from not being able
to see his daughter daily,